# S38-S41-id: the hall at 16:9 as id mapped it: fov 90 across the width, so the wide
# picture is the 4:3 one with its top and bottom cut away.
#
# Assembly: S38 ("id spread its") is S38-S41-4x3 shown 1440x1080 (area-averaged) in the
# frame's centre to file second 4.5; from 3.0, rust lines mark where id's 16:9 cuts it (it
# keeps the central three quarters of the rows) and the rows beyond dim; over 4.5 to 6.0
# (smoothstep) the picture grows to 1920x1440, cut to the frame, so the lines ride out to
# its edges; late in that growth it settles onto S38-S41-id (the same picture). S39
# ("Horizontal plus keeps") cross-fades S38-S41-id to S38-S41-horplus between film seconds
# 9.3 and 10.3 (smoothstep), then a bronze outline of the 4:3 box fades in from 10.6. S38
# is the master's frames 0 to 617, S39 498 to 965.

map e1m5

duration 24
fps 60
size 1920x1080
frames 240..678

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar fov_adapt 0

camera path
key 0   -1536,1423.91,200  0,90  ease linear
key 24  -1536,1618.09,200  0,90

events on
